37
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:44,920
Wow.

38
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,440
I've never seen a human with numbers like these before.

39
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,960
Oh, yes!

40
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,120
Whoever this is, he's a total phenom.

41
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,280
A one in a million find for sure.

42
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,380
No, he's more like a one in a hundred million find.

43
00:02:56,380 --> 00:03:00,340
He'll be able to get Gea Brande back in order in no time,

44
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:03,460
and they'll be that much closer to being a super high-ranking goddess!

45
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:04,080
Oh, yes!

46
