Heh! Yeah!

47
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:08,460
I'm the luckiest goddess there ever was!

48
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:09,340
Ha, ha, ha!

49
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:29,460
By the power of the goddess Restarte, I now summon a hero to the sacred chamber.

50
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:34,060
Come forth!

51
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,700
Seiya Ryugui!

52
00:03:35,700 --> 00:03:37,340
Well, he's dreamy.

53
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:43,020
He's six feet tall with noble features under that luscious, dark hair, and it gives off an aura that's as heavenly as the great gods in the unified divine realm.

54
00:03:43,020 --> 00:04:10,040
Oh, I could lose myself in passionate love with a man like this!

55
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:14,600
Wait! A goddess getting involved in a steamy romance with a human is uber-forbidden!

56
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:16,860
