57
00:04:17,580 --> 00:04:19,840
Greetings, I am the goddess known as Restarte.

58
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:26,320
I know this must be quite shocking, but it is out of urgent necessity that I have summoned you from the human world into our dimension.

59
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:33,340
Hearken to my words carefully, say Ryugui, and for you are the hero chosen to save the world of Gea Brande from the Demon Lord.

60
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,560
He's so enchanted by me that he can't even speak!

61
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:40,020
But I mean, who can blame him? I am a goddess after all.

62
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,420
