63
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,660
What kind of freak drops a bomb like this on a stranger?

64
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:47,060
Who's a freak?! Are you talking about me?!

65
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:50,600
Oops! Calm down, Rista. A goddess must always maintain her composure.

66
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:54,160
Ahem! I'm sure that you must be mystified by me.

67
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:59,640
