68
00:04:59,740 --> 00:05:03,540
If you're really a goddess, couldn't you just save whatever the hell world it was by yourself?

69
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:05,920
Well, there are rules in place.

70
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:10,880
The gods have created countless worlds where the humans are to prosper by their own efforts.

71
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:15,380
